      "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2K3tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8hAQAA9aepVa8Z+rFZTCj8F5rLrW\npSB1xhILsU3voGz8r8sA3wACdJ9QVe/OExlYQkMi+PMtimvtbXrhkiPTaYc8UMnV\n5iEtdhjGkHcWNe58yMhf4L7NG/xSF09O9jPTJXk/rUWWaCrkUq7xOMC77qf8Tjdp\nX9p1NuRX3d0po3249HIoVlG8Qn8eqpLEkGZmDErG+SLPPFy2Lo/fkGePcl+rZ3nZ\nyX7eWnoT0VItdk2TwFS+V+k/qGyBzHzIeM7LLuuXBJ6cJyZ4HCu5CX/Ox/1gsWrP\nwYEha8yWwwLurBsvJq/8i/kqwnUwpCww7tE5FlW/lblZVwsTsh+SaUEPwM29EcNS\nsFx5fHx39iVWF2e6nZpJZQyU81OM9VPFbG9DFTvAFbt0HmnKfLo7Pp5cX+FgJvng\nC6EpQftlowxwwpGnMZlKuhwpbRd3LD/A124VB96vgeMvmh/Orn0joDVd1PUkPcZe\nnbFmP/+M+01m6YwIVLdzYAimDHKcK+/z7TEYRVHP7iS99h1cAoWeIPC+QPaPOgTS\nFPWlk3OMdob3cmQzFEtmsl72g7ei1dGspZSzF2x+X+wI6w6kmEfLJt8W82RTqRCK\nWq/zhcIThwDnkc2rydI3DLOFhDknyHkPqEJMSEnjWwC8Ytz63tL6cCgeIOAnn9y2\nLDyRAbkqeHr7xfFPABFS\n=4WW9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
      "payload": "tree b55a7e08444cdfd32d85cfc3c317a80d65f8d314\nparent 90ba725757611be64d5b75c732513fc6a5be03a0\nauthor SaladDay <1203511142@qq.com> 1792585197 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792585197 +0800\n\nReuse finished Environment preparation across Sessions (#808)\n\n* Reuse finished Environment preparation across Sessions\n\nCore computes a key from the Project, initial files and setup operations and calls RestorePreparation/SavePreparation on the Provider. On a hit only finalize runs. The microsandbox helper owns storage, a 24 hour TTL and an 8 GiB bound. The daemon rebinds an identical restored capability installation.\n\n* Keep Runtime state out of the preparation archive\n\n* Drop a preparation entry that fails to extract and bound its save\n\n* Accept preparation fields in strict node frames",
