      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/contracts%2Fagents-api%2Fzh%2Fnode-generation-protocol.md",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/contracts%2Fagents-api%2Fzh%2Fnode-generation-protocol.md?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@\n ---\n title: \"沙箱节点协议\"\n source: contracts/agents-api/node-generation-protocol.md\n-source_hash: 21fb07f531d4087de59618e5f34211d5dc9674efe97530501170950e8a76f6f2\n+source_hash: a8135ed519bdc897237cef7f69c78dde638ab76877c67f096b1e5aef9f28b80b\n ---\n \n 沙箱节点协议连接 Core 与 Docker 或 microsandbox 主机：主机针对其本地提供商执行提供商操作，并报告就绪状态、主机测量值及其持有的部署代次。\n@@ -87,12 +87,14 @@ Core 发送包含以下内容的 `request` 帧：\n | `suspend` | `Suspend` | `suspend` | `state` |\n | `resume` | `Resume` | `resume` | `state` |\n | `delete_snapshot` | `DeleteSnapshot` | `snapshot` | 无 |\n+| `restore_preparation` | `RestorePreparation` | `key` | `restored` |\n+| `save_preparation` | `SavePreparation` | `key` | 无 |\n \n 只要 `connection_id`、`owner_epoch` 或 `sequence` 中任一值不匹配，请求就会关闭连接。格式错误的请求会得到 `invalid` 响应。节点在所指 `deployment_generation` 的提供商上运行请求，无法运行时回复 `unconfirmed`。Core 仅向节点上已就绪的代次发送 `create` 和非 observe-only 的 `resume`，并且每条连接最多保留 32 个待处理请求。\n \n 预算采用相对计时：节点收到请求时以自己的时钟为基准锚定 `timeout_ms`，并在请求排队等待期间持续消耗该预算，因此各主机的时钟无需保持一致。Core 仍会限制自身等待时长。节点队列已满时会关闭连接。\n \n-`response` 帧包含 `id` 和 `connection_id`。成功响应携带操作表中指定的结果；对于 `kill`、`kill_compute` 或 `delete_snapshot`，响应不含结果字段。失败响应携带一个 `error_code`：\n+`response` 帧包含 `id` 和 `connection_id`。成功响应携带操作表中指定的结果；对于 `kill`、`kill_compute`、`delete_snapshot` 或 `save_preparation`，响应不含结果字段。失败响应携带一个 `error_code`：\n \n | `error_code` | 含义 |\n | --- | --- |"
    },
    {
      "sha": "439b11a4c615917bf5f4ea2152920d7bdd9291a1",
      "filename": "docs/sandbox-provider.md",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 3,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 3,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/docs%2Fsandbox-provider.md",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/docs%2Fsandbox-provider.md",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/docs%2Fsandbox-provider.md?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -63,9 +63,12 @@ Every provider returns a complete `ProviderOperations()` declaration with one en\n | `Create`, `GetInfo`, `Renew`, `Kill`, `RunCommand` | Supported | Allocation lifecycle and bounded commands |\n | `Observe` | Explicit decision | Ownership-checked read-only observation of one allocation |\n | `Initial`, `NewCompute`, `GetCompute`, `Suspend`, `Resume`, `ResumeCompute`, `KillCompute`, `DeleteSnapshot`, `RunCommandCompute` | The same decision for every checkpoint method; supported only by a `nodes` registration | Exact compute incarnations, capture and restore, retained-source resume and cleanup |\n+| `RestorePreparation`, `SavePreparation` | The same decision for both | Reuse of a finished Environment preparation |\n \n `Initial` and `NewCompute` construct compute references without allocating, `ResumeCompute` thaws only the same resident instance after an aborted pause, and `RunCommandCompute` runs a bounded command in one exact compute incarnation. Core uses `RunCommandCompute` to wake a parked daemon after a restore ([`runtime_compute_wake.go`](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/main/services/core/internal/execution/runtime_compute_wake.go)).\n \n+`SavePreparation(reference, key)` stores what preparation wrote under `/environment` (workspace, packages and initialization, never Runtime state) in the allocation's initial compute after a complete preparation, and `RestorePreparation(reference, key)` puts a stored one back and returns `false` when it holds no valid entry. The `key` is opaque: Core derives it from the Project and everything that reaches preparation, never from the Environment, Session, Harness or Agent, and the Provider never interprets it. The Provider owns storage, scoping to its Runtime image, expiry and eviction. An entry is valid for 24 hours after its save, and a restore must not use an expired one. Core calls `RestorePreparation` after the Runtime connects and, on a hit, sends only the `finalize` operation before completing initialization. On a miss it prepares in full and calls `SavePreparation`; a save error is logged and never fails the Session. A Provider that declares neither always prepares in full. The microsandbox adapter keeps one archive per key in a private directory under the Runtime home.\n+\n Each declaration entry is `state: supported` with no reason, or `state: unsupported` with an authored reason code. Missing, zero, unknown or unsafe entries fail validation. Adding a method to `SandboxProvider` requires an explicit decision and implementation in every adapter; never supply a base type or generate blanket unsupported implementations.\n \n An unsupported method returns `providercontract.UnsupportedError` before any native I/O. The error names the exact operation and a safe code, never a native message, resource identity, endpoint or credential. An empty result, a nil error, `Unavailable` or an unknown mutation outcome never stands in for unsupported, and the five required methods can never return it."
    },
    {
      "sha": "e75c0911754886cd055278c74bd68b528c8ed40f",
      "filename": "docs/zh/sandbox-provider.md",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 4,
      "deletions": 1,
      "changes": 5,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/docs%2Fzh%2Fsandbox-provider.md",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/docs%2Fzh%2Fsandbox-provider.md",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/docs%2Fzh%2Fsandbox-provider.md?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@\n ---\n title: \"沙箱提供商协议\"\n source: docs/sandbox-provider.md\n-source_hash: 19dcc4268e7d7ed547c1de470ba1bf0f771a35e909a4f869daaeefeddffeea7c\n+source_hash: 95b02d2c1b46117e603ebadd5fa948c92624c3eb59d50cc402eb5a3907e69378\n ---\n \n 沙箱提供商协议连接 Core 与为 Core 管理的（`openai_hosted`）Environment 提供计算资源的 adapter，并由该 adapter 运行启动 Runtime daemon 的有界引导流程。本页面向 adapter 作者：说明提供商必须实现什么，以及可以依赖 Core 做什么。Docker、microsandbox 和 E2B 实现了该协议。\n@@ -65,9 +65,12 @@ Docker 等没有原生可续期租约的 backend 仍遵守 Core 的 hosted expir\n | `Create`、`GetInfo`、`Renew`、`Kill`、`RunCommand` | 支持 | Allocation 生命周期与有界命令 |\n | `Observe` | 明确决定 | 检查所有权、只读地观测一个 allocation |\n | `Initial`、`NewCompute`、`GetCompute`、`Suspend`、`Resume`、`ResumeCompute`、`KillCompute`、`DeleteSnapshot`、`RunCommandCompute` | 所有 checkpoint 方法决定一致；仅 `nodes` 注册可以支持 | 精确计算实例、捕获与恢复、保留源恢复和清理 |\n+| `RestorePreparation`、`SavePreparation` | 两者决定一致 | 复用已完成的 Environment 准备结果 |\n \n `Initial` 和 `NewCompute` 构造 compute reference，不分配资源；`ResumeCompute` 在暂停中止后仅解冻同一驻留实例；`RunCommandCompute` 在一个精确 compute incarnation 中运行有界命令。Core 使用 `RunCommandCompute` 在恢复后唤醒 parked daemon（[`runtime_compute_wake.go`](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/main/services/core/internal/execution/runtime_compute_wake.go)）。\n \n+`SavePreparation(reference, key)` 在准备完整完成后保存该分配初始 compute 中准备写入 `/environment` 的内容（workspace、packages 和 initialization，从不包括 Runtime 状态），`RestorePreparation(reference, key)` 把已保存的内容放回，没有有效条目时返回 `false`。`key` 是不透明的：Core 由 Project 和所有进入准备的内容推导它，从不使用 Environment、Session、Harness 或 Agent，提供商也从不解释它。存储、按 Runtime 镜像划分范围、过期和淘汰由提供商负责。条目在保存后 24 小时内有效，恢复不得使用已过期的条目。Core 在 Runtime 连接后调用 `RestorePreparation`，命中时只发送 `finalize` 操作即完成初始化。未命中时完整准备并调用 `SavePreparation`；保存错误只记录日志，不会使 Session 失败。两者都未声明的提供商始终完整准备。microsandbox 适配器在 Runtime home 下的私有目录中为每个 key 保存一个归档。\n+\n 每个声明项为不带 reason 的 `state: supported`，或带 authored reason code 的 `state: unsupported`。缺失、零值、未知或不安全项都会验证失败。给 `SandboxProvider` 添加方法时，必须在每个 adapter 中明确决定并实现；不提供 base type，也不生成笼统的不支持实现。\n \n 不支持的方法在任何原生 I/O 前返回 `providercontract.UnsupportedError`。错误指明精确操作和安全 code，不包含原生消息、资源身份、endpoint 或凭据。空结果、nil error、`Unavailable` 或未知 mutation 结果都不能代替 unsupported，五项必需方法不能返回 unsupported。"
    },
    {
      "sha": "ac9585e44f4b1e954d45034d486121237ccfd0f9",
      "filename": "internal/agentcapabilities/install.go",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 15,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 15,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/internal%2Fagentcapabilities%2Finstall.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/internal%2Fagentcapabilities%2Finstall.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/internal%2Fagentcapabilities%2Finstall.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -104,6 +104,21 @@ func Finalize(installed *os.Root, input Input, identity Identity, resolve Direct\n \t\t\treturn ErrInvalid\n \t\t}\n \t}\n+\treturn writeManifest(installed, manifest)\n+}\n+\n+// Rebind gives an installation restored from an earlier preparation the identity\n+// of this Session. The earlier preparation must have had the identical selection.\n+func Rebind(installed *os.Root, manifest *Manifest, input Input, identity Identity) error {\n+\tdigest, err := selectionHash(input)\n+\tif err != nil || validateIdentity(identity) != nil || manifest.Version != 1 || manifest.SelectionSHA256 != digest {\n+\t\treturn ErrInvalid\n+\t}\n+\tmanifest.Identity = identity\n+\treturn writeManifest(installed, *manifest)\n+}\n+\n+func writeManifest(installed *os.Root, manifest Manifest) error {\n \tbody, err := json.Marshal(manifest)\n \tif err != nil || len(body) > 256<<10 || writeFile(installed, ManifestName+\".tmp\", body, 0400) != nil || installed.Rename(ManifestName+\".tmp\", ManifestName) != nil {\n \t\treturn ErrInvalid"
    },
    {
      "sha": "bacf142d905ae027facf27d31e055eb4c1c3b1c3",
      "filename": "services/core/cmd/server/managed_generation_operations.go",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 22,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 22,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Fcmd%2Fserver%2Fmanaged_generation_operations.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Fcmd%2Fserver%2Fmanaged_generation_operations.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Fcmd%2Fserver%2Fmanaged_generation_operations.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -105,3 +105,25 @@ func (p *generationRouter) ResumeCompute(ctx context.Context, r sandbox.Referenc\n \tdefer done()\n \treturn v.ResumeCompute(ctx, r, c)\n }\n+func (p *generationRouter) RestorePreparation(ctx context.Context, r sandbox.Reference, key string) (bool, error) {\n+\tif err := providercontract.Require(p, \"RestorePreparation\"); err != nil {\n+\t\treturn false, err\n+\t}\n+\tv, done, err := p.route(ctx, r)\n+\tif err != nil {\n+\t\treturn false, err\n+\t}\n+\tdefer done()\n+\treturn v.RestorePreparation(ctx, r, key)\n+}\n+func (p *generationRouter) SavePreparation(ctx context.Context, r sandbox.Reference, key string) error {\n+\tif err := providercontract.Require(p, \"SavePreparation\"); err != nil {\n+\t\treturn err\n+\t}\n+\tv, done, err := p.route(ctx, r)\n+\tif err != nil {\n+\t\treturn err\n+\t}\n+\tdefer done()\n+\treturn v.SavePreparation(ctx, r, key)\n+}"
    },
    {
      "sha": "58b17c3a82505c38abdd5b05dea44be405ddd9ab",
      "filename": "services/core/internal/execution/provider_operations_fixture_test.go",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 23,
      "deletions": 15,
      "changes": 38,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fprovider_operations_fixture_test.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fprovider_operations_fixture_test.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fprovider_operations_fixture_test.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -10,21 +10,23 @@ import (\n \n func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) ProviderOperations() providercontract.Operations {\n \treturn providercontract.Operations{\n-\t\t\"Create\":            {State: providercontract.Supported},\n-\t\t\"GetInfo\":           {State: providercontract.Supported},\n-\t\t\"Renew\":             {State: providercontract.Supported},\n-\t\t\"Kill\":              {State: providercontract.Supported},\n-\t\t\"RunCommand\":        {State: providercontract.Supported},\n-\t\t\"Initial\":           {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"NewCompute\":        {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"GetCompute\":        {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"Suspend\":           {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"Resume\":            {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"KillCompute\":       {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"DeleteSnapshot\":    {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"RunCommandCompute\": {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"ResumeCompute\":     {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n-\t\t\"Observe\":           {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"Create\":             {State: providercontract.Supported},\n+\t\t\"GetInfo\":            {State: providercontract.Supported},\n+\t\t\"Renew\":              {State: providercontract.Supported},\n+\t\t\"Kill\":               {State: providercontract.Supported},\n+\t\t\"RunCommand\":         {State: providercontract.Supported},\n+\t\t\"Initial\":            {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"NewCompute\":         {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"GetCompute\":         {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"Suspend\":            {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"Resume\":             {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"KillCompute\":        {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"DeleteSnapshot\":     {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"RunCommandCompute\":  {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"ResumeCompute\":      {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"RestorePreparation\": {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"SavePreparation\":    {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n+\t\t\"Observe\":            {State: providercontract.Unsupported, Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"},\n \t}\n }\n func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) Initial(context.Context, sandbox.Reference) (sandbox.Compute, error) {\n@@ -57,3 +59,9 @@ func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) ResumeCompute(context.Context, sandbox.Reference, s\n func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) Observe(context.Context, runtimeobs.Target) (runtimeobs.Sample, error) {\n \treturn runtimeobs.Sample{}, &providercontract.UnsupportedError{Operation: \"Observe\", Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"}\n }\n+func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) RestorePreparation(context.Context, sandbox.Reference, string) (bool, error) {\n+\treturn false, &providercontract.UnsupportedError{Operation: \"RestorePreparation\", Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"}\n+}\n+func (*lifecycleOnlySandbox) SavePreparation(context.Context, sandbox.Reference, string) error {\n+\treturn &providercontract.UnsupportedError{Operation: \"SavePreparation\", Reason: \"fixture_operation_not_supported\"}\n+}"
    },
    {
      "sha": "14cf1e2032ac6f295ecaeb0a8a6d002bbd8144ab",
      "filename": "services/core/internal/execution/runtime_initialization.go",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 26,
      "deletions": 10,
      "changes": 36,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_initialization.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_initialization.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_initialization.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -140,8 +140,8 @@ func (w *Worker) prepareEnvironment(ctx context.Context, owner sessions.Environm\n \t}\n \tidentity := agentcapabilities.Identity{EnvironmentID: owner.EnvironmentID, SessionID: owner.SessionID}\n \toperations := setupOperations(setup)\n-\tfor index := 0; index < len(cfg.Files)+len(operations); index++ {\n-\t\terr = w.lease.CheckOwnership(ctx)\n+\tstep := func(index int) error {\n+\t\terr := w.lease.CheckOwnership(ctx)\n \t\tif err == nil {\n \t\t\tvar currentPeer = peer\n \t\t\tcurrentPeer, err = w.dispatcher.authorizedPeer(ctx, owner.DeviceID)\n@@ -162,14 +162,30 @@ func (w *Worker) prepareEnvironment(ctx context.Context, owner sessions.Environm\n \t\t\tcandidate = command.provisioningFailure(0)\n \t\t\terr = runRuntimeSetup(ctx, peer, identity, command)\n \t\t}\n-\t\tif err != nil {\n-\t\t\tvar confirmed *runtimeStepFailure\n-\t\t\tif errors.As(err, &confirmed) {\n-\t\t\t\tcandidate.ExitCode = confirmed.exitCode\n-\t\t\t\t*failure = candidate\n-\t\t\t}\n-\t\t\treturn err\n+\t\tvar confirmed *runtimeStepFailure\n+\t\tif errors.As(err, &confirmed) {\n+\t\t\tcandidate.ExitCode = confirmed.exitCode\n+\t\t\t*failure = candidate\n \t\t}\n+\t\treturn err\n \t}\n-\treturn nil\n+\ttotal := len(cfg.Files) + len(operations)\n+\tcache, err := w.preparationCache(ctx, owner, len(cfg.Files), operations)\n+\tif err != nil {\n+\t\treturn err\n+\t}\n+\treturn cache.run(ctx, func() error {\n+\t\tfor index := 0; index < total; index++ {\n+\t\t\tif err := step(index); err != nil {\n+\t\t\t\treturn err\n+\t\t\t}\n+\t\t}\n+\t\treturn nil\n+\t}, func() error {\n+\t\t// Only finalize binds the restored capability installation to this Session.\n+\t\tif len(operations) > 0 && operations[len(operations)-1].Request.Action == \"finalize\" {\n+\t\t\treturn step(total - 1)\n+\t\t}\n+\t\treturn nil\n+\t})\n }"
    },
    {
      "sha": "339bea38bb77a0f94a18adc743c69b77649c5f5a",
      "filename": "services/core/internal/execution/runtime_manager.go",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 11,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 11,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_manager.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_manager.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_manager.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -14,6 +14,17 @@ import (\n \t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/workspaces\"\n )\n \n+// provider returns the configured Provider and its installation, or nil during\n+// a deployment switch.\n+func (m *runtimeManager) provider() (sandbox.SandboxProvider, string) {\n+\tm.mu.Lock()\n+\tdefer m.mu.Unlock()\n+\tif m.switching {\n+\t\treturn nil, \"\"\n+\t}\n+\treturn m.config.Provider, m.config.InstallationID\n+}\n+\n // runtimeManager owns node membership, not provider operations. Each registered\n // node has one serial lifecycle; slow provider work cannot occupy another node.\n var errRuntimeTransition = fmt.Errorf(\"%w: sandbox configuration is changing\", ErrExecutionUnavailable)"
    },
    {
      "sha": "fb388379aaea7857299eece521a3ad4d20c343b3",
      "filename": "services/core/internal/execution/runtime_preparation_cache.go",
      "status": "added",
      "additions": 94,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 94,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@\n+package execution\n+\n+import (\n+\t\"context\"\n+\t\"crypto/sha256\"\n+\t\"encoding/hex\"\n+\t\"encoding/json\"\n+\t\"errors\"\n+\t\"time\"\n+\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/internal/obs/log\"\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/deployment\"\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/providercontract\"\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/sandbox\"\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/sessions\"\n+)\n+\n+// preparationCache reuses the result of an earlier preparation with the same key\n+// through a Provider that declares the operations. The Provider owns storage and\n+// lifetime; Core only computes the key.\n+type preparationCache struct {\n+\tprovider  sandbox.SandboxProvider\n+\treference sandbox.Reference\n+\tkey       string\n+}\n+\n+// preparationCache returns nil when this Environment cannot use the cache: no\n+// preparation work, no declared operations or an allocation of another installation.\n+func (w *Worker) preparationCache(ctx context.Context, owner sessions.EnvironmentInitialization, fileCount int, operations []runtimeSetupOperation) (*preparationCache, error) {\n+\tprovider, installation := w.runtimes.provider()\n+\tif fileCount+len(operations) == 0 || provider == nil || providercontract.Require(provider, \"RestorePreparation\") != nil {\n+\t\treturn nil, nil\n+\t}\n+\tallocation, err := w.dispatcher.DeploymentReader.EnvironmentAllocation(ctx, deployment.AllocationKey{TenantID: owner.TenantID, EnvironmentID: owner.EnvironmentID})\n+\tif errors.Is(err, deployment.ErrNotFound) || err == nil && (allocation.ProviderKey != installation || allocation.State != \"running\") {\n+\t\treturn nil, nil\n+\t}\n+\tif err != nil {\n+\t\treturn nil, err\n+\t}\n+\thash := sha256.New()\n+\tencoder := json.NewEncoder(hash)\n+\t_ = encoder.Encode(owner.TenantID)\n+\tfor index := range fileCount {\n+\t\tmetadata, body, err := w.dispatcher.SessionsReader.ReadInitialEnvironmentFile(ctx, owner.TenantID, owner.SessionID, index)\n+\t\tif err != nil {\n+\t\t\treturn nil, err\n+\t\t}\n+\t\tdigest := sha256.Sum256(body)\n+\t\t_ = encoder.Encode([]string{metadata.Path, hex.EncodeToString(digest[:])})\n+\t}\n+\tfor _, operation := range operations {\n+\t\tdigest := sha256.Sum256(operation.Data)\n+\t\t_ = encoder.Encode(operation.Request)\n+\t\t_ = encoder.Encode(hex.EncodeToString(digest[:]))\n+\t}\n+\treturn &preparationCache{provider, runtimeReference(allocation), hex.EncodeToString(hash.Sum(nil))}, nil\n+}\n+\n+// run restores a saved preparation and sends only finalize, which binds the\n+// restored installation to this Session. Otherwise it prepares and saves the\n+// result. A failed save never fails the Session.\n+func (c *preparationCache) run(ctx context.Context, prepare, finalize func() error) error {\n+\tif c == nil {\n+\t\treturn prepare()\n+\t}\n+\tstarted := time.Now()\n+\trestored, err := c.provider.RestorePreparation(ctx, c.reference, c.key)\n+\tc.log(ctx, \"restore_preparation\", restored, started, err)\n+\tif err != nil {\n+\t\treturn err\n+\t}\n+\tif restored {\n+\t\treturn finalize()\n+\t}\n+\tif err := prepare(); err != nil {\n+\t\treturn err\n+\t}\n+\tstarted = time.Now()\n+\tsave := ctx\n+\tif deadline, bounded := ctx.Deadline(); bounded {\n+\t\t// Half the remaining budget, so a slow save never takes the time completion needs.\n+\t\tvar cancel context.CancelFunc\n+\t\tsave, cancel = context.WithTimeout(ctx, time.Until(deadline)/2)\n+\t\tdefer cancel()\n+\t}\n+\tc.log(ctx, \"save_preparation\", false, started, c.provider.SavePreparation(save, c.reference, c.key))\n+\treturn nil\n+}\n+\n+func (c *preparationCache) log(ctx context.Context, step string, hit bool, started time.Time, err error) {\n+\tlog.Ctx(ctx).Info(\"Environment preparation cache\", \"allocation_id\", c.reference.AllocationID, \"step\", step, \"hit\", hit,\n+\t\t\"duration_ms\", time.Since(started).Milliseconds(), \"succeeded\", err == nil)\n+}"
    },
    {
      "sha": "fb2ea9d41415989a56e0af1194ee9cad02b190ee",
      "filename": "services/core/internal/execution/runtime_preparation_cache_test.go",
      "status": "added",
      "additions": 48,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 48,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/blob/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache_test.go",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/raw/c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache_test.go",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/contents/services%2Fcore%2Finternal%2Fexecution%2Fruntime_preparation_cache_test.go?ref=c2ed21de2e3e0715dd6d382bee71188d7b365313",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@\n+package execution\n+\n+import (\n+\t\"context\"\n+\t\"errors\"\n+\t\"testing\"\n+\n+\t\"github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/services/core/internal/sandbox\"\n+)\n+\n+type preparationProvider struct {\n+\tsandbox.SandboxProvider\n+\thit     bool\n+\tsaveErr error\n+\tsaved   []string\n+}\n+\n+func (p *preparationProvider) RestorePreparation(context.Context, sandbox.Reference, string) (bool, error) {\n+\treturn p.hit, nil\n+}\n+func (p *preparationProvider) SavePreparation(_ context.Context, _ sandbox.Reference, key string) error {\n+\tp.saved = append(p.saved, key)\n+\treturn p.saveErr\n+}\n+\n+func TestPreparationCacheHitFinalizesMissPreparesAndSaves(t *testing.T) {\n+\tfor _, test := range []struct {\n+\t\tname                string\n+\t\thit                 bool\n+\t\tsaveErr             error\n+\t\tprepared, finalized int\n+\t\tsaved               int\n+\t}{\n+\t\t{\"hit\", true, nil, 0, 1, 0},\n+\t\t{\"miss\", false, nil, 1, 0, 1},\n+\t\t{\"failed save\", false, errors.New(\"disk full\"), 1, 0, 1},\n+\t} {\n+\t\tt.Run(test.name, func(t *testing.T) {\n+\t\t\tprovider := &preparationProvider{hit: test.hit, saveErr: test.saveErr}\n+\t\t\tvar prepared, finalized int\n+\t\t\tcache := &preparationCache{provider: provider, key: \"key\"}\n+\t\t\terr := cache.run(context.Background(), func() error { prepared++; return nil }, func() error { finalized++; return nil })\n+\t\t\tif err != nil || prepared != test.prepared || finalized != test.finalized || len(provider.saved) != test.saved {\n+\t\t\t\tt.Fatal(err, prepared, finalized, provider.saved)\n+\t\t\t}\n+\t\t})\n+\t}\n+}"
    },
    {
      "sha": "0e2ac9c0d957800aaae86b56157bb1257383302c",
